{"id":"wb-7-1202","name":"密县县衙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"密县县衙","text":"密县县衙位于河南省郑州市新密市城关镇，地处密县老县城的中心，在隋朝至20世纪70年代的1300余年间均为密县的县治处所。县衙始建于隋大业十二年（公元616年），毁于元，现存建筑为清康熙年间时任知县衷鲲化在原址重修。2013年3月，密县县衙被国务院公布为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AF%86%E5%8E%BF%E5%8E%BF%E8%A1%99","revisionId":89749350,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89749350","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b2e029981d69e3c54f758d4c.jpg","title":"20210509_The_Yamen_of_Mi_County_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20210509_The_Yamen_of_Mi_County_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3c/20210509_The_Yamen_of_Mi_County_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"The Yamen of Mi County","width":320,"height":213}}